ADDITIONAL NOTICES

1. MEDICAL DISCLAIMER

   This software is an AI-assisted screening and educational decision-support
   system. It is NOT a medical device, NOT a diagnostic system, and has NOT
   been evaluated or approved by any medical regulatory authority.

   It must not be used as a substitute for professional medical advice,
   diagnosis, or treatment. Always seek the advice of a qualified health
   provider with any questions regarding a medical condition.

2. DATASET LICENSING

   The datasets this project trains on are licensed separately and are NOT
   covered by the MIT license above. No dataset is distributed with this
   repository.

   HAM10000 is licensed CC BY-NC-SA 4.0 (non-commercial, share-alike). Models
   trained on it inherit that restriction. Cite:

     Tschandl, P., Rosendahl, C. & Kittler, H. The HAM10000 dataset, a large
     collection of multi-source dermatoscopic images of common pigmented skin
     lesions. Sci. Data 5, 180161 (2018).

   Check the licence of any additional dataset before use.

3. MODEL WEIGHTS

   Pretrained ImageNet weights are obtained from torchvision and carry their
   own licences. Fine-tuned checkpoints produced by this project inherit the
   restrictions of the datasets they were trained on.
